# Phase 4.2: transient Commerce corpus cache — holds real image URLs, never committed (§57).
vto-phase4-pipeline/.corpus-cache/

# Stray VTO E2E harness scratch files. On Windows the harness writes an
# absolute temp path that git-bash materializes as a LITERAL filename in the
# repo root (the ':' becomes U+F03A), so `git add -A` will otherwise commit
# them. Observed empty; ignored so a local full-suite run cannot contaminate
# a branch. See docs/vto-phase4-2-defect-ledger.md P42-006.
C*UsersjsmitAppDataLocalTempvto-e2e-*.json
*AppDataLocalTempvto-e2e-*.json
